) \n   \n 19:00 – Drop to the Hotel \n   \n Overnight in Ganja', 113.0, 119.0, 137.0, 148.0, 325.0, 442.0, 709.0, 677.0, 677.0, 40.0, 65.0);
INSERT INTO transfers (duty_code, a, b, service, distance, start_time, duration_mins, day_schedule, sedan_4_local, sedan_4_english, vito_8_local, vito_8_english, sprinter_18, isuzu_27, merc_403_45, trivago_54, neoplan_48, guides_a, guides_o) VALUES (33, 'Baku', 'Baku', 'Day Trip', NULL, NULL, NULL, '08:00 – Leaving Baku to Gakh (1 way x 5 hrs) \n   \n 13:00 – Lunch Break \n   \n 14:00 – Visit Ilisu Village \n  - Ilisu is a historic mountain village known for its stone houses, fresh air, waterfalls, and panoramic views. The village reflects preserved Caucasian architecture and traditional lifestyle. \n   \n 15:00 – Visit Ulu Mosque (Ilisu Mosque) \n  - Dating back to the 16th century, this mosque is an important cultural and religious landmark of the region and one of the oldest preserved Islamic structures in Gakh. \n   \n 16:00 – Visit Sumug Gala (Defensive Tower) \n  - A medieval defensive tower once used to guard Ilisu and monitor strategic mountain routes. Today it stands as a symbol of local heritage and offers scenic photo points. \n   \n 16:30 – Leaving Gakh to Baku \n   \n 21:00 – Dinner Break (if included) \n   \n 22:00 – Drop to the Hotel \n   \n Overnight in Baku', 77.0, 83.0, 101.0, 112.0, 295.0, 383.0, 442.0, 500.0, 500.0, 20.0, 47.0);
