omplex showcasing medieval Azerbaijani architecture. \n   \n 18:00 – Dinner Break (if includes) \n   \n 19:00 – Drop to the Hotel  \n   \n Overnight in Baku', 41.0, 47.0, 47.0, 59.0, 118.0, 147.0, 177.0, 206.0, 206.0, 20.0, 47.0);
