  endless stone stairs.) \n   \n  -Flame Towers (The city''s tallest building. The height of 182 m.  \n  Flame Towers - consisting of three high-rise buildings in the complex.)', 41.0, 47.0, 47.0, 59.0, 41.0, 118.0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12.0, 42.0);
