ract architecture is unlike anything  \n  else in the capital city. The Heydar Aliyev Center, which was  \n  designed by renowned architect Zaha Hadid.)', 41.0, 47.0, 47.0, 59.0, 41.0, 118.0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12.0, 42.0);
